  "body_html": "<h1>Support Complementarity</h1>\n<p>Let $x \\in X(A)$ and $y \\in Y(A)$.  If $i \\in \\operatorname{supp}(x)$, then\nthe pure row $i$ obtains the value against $y$.  If\n$j \\in \\operatorname{supp}(y)$, then the mixed strategy $x$ obtains the value\nagainst the pure column $j$.</p>",
